k theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class=menu__link href=/community/><span class=linkLabel_yPoK>Overview</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a href=https://github.com/openbao/openbao/discussions target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="menu__link menuExternalLink_dsr7"><span class=linkLabel_yPoK>GitHub Discussions</span><svg width=13.5 height=13.5 aria-label="(opens in new tab)" class=iconExternalLink_ywOY><use href=#theme-svg-external-link /></svg></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/ target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="menu__link menuExternalLink_dsr7"><span class=linkLabel_yPoK>Zulip Chat Server</span><svg width=13.5 height=13.5 aria-label="(opens in new tab)" class=iconExternalLink_ywOY><use href=#theme-svg-external-link /></svg></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed"><div class=menu__list-item-collapsible><a class="categoryLink_A07R menu__link menu__link--sublist menu__link--sublist-caret" role=button aria-expanded=false href=/community/release-notes/><span class=categoryLinkLabel_wPnK>Release Notes</span></a></div><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed"><div class=menu__list-item-collapsible><a class="categoryLink_A07R menu__link menu__link--sublist menu__link--sublist-caret" role=button aria-expanded=false href=/community/deprecation/><span class=categoryLinkLabel_wPnK>Deprecation Notices</span></a></div><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class=menu__link href=/community/known-issues/><span class=linkLabel_yPoK>Known issues</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item"><div class=menu__list-item-collapsible><a class="categoryLink_A07R menu__link menu__link--sublist menu__link--sublist-caret menu__link--active" role=button aria-expanded=true href=/community/contributing/><span class=categoryLinkLabel_wPnK>Contributing</span></a></div><ul class=menu__list><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-2 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link menu__link--active" aria-current=page tabindex=0 href=/community/contributing/><span class=linkLabel_yPoK>Contributing</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-2 menu__list-item"><a class=menu__link tabindex=0 href=/community/contributing/code-organization/><span class=linkLabel_yPoK>Code organization</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-2 menu__list-item"><a class=menu__link tabindex=0 href=/community/contributing/packaging/><span class=linkLabel_yPoK>Packaging guide</span></a></ul><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed"><div class=menu__list-item-collapsible><a class="categoryLink_A07R menu__link menu__link--sublist menu__link--sublist-caret" role=button aria-expanded=false href=/community/policies/><span class=categoryLinkLabel_wPnK>Policies</span></a></div><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed"><div class=menu__list-item-collapsible><a class="categoryLink_A07R menu__link menu__link--sublist menu__link--sublist-caret" role=button aria-expanded=false href=/community/rfcs/><span class=categoryLinkLabel_wPnK>RFCs</span></a></div><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a href=https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/CHARTER.md target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="menu__link menuExternalLink_dsr7"><span class=linkLabel_yPoK>Charter</span><svg width=13.5 height=13.5 aria-label="(opens in new tab)" class=iconExternalLink_ywOY><use href=#theme-svg-external-link /></svg></a></ul></nav></div></div></aside><main class=docMainContainer_pQnC><div class="container padding-top--md padding-bottom--lg"><div class=row><div class="col docItemCol_QHbu"><div class=docItemContainer_mGFe><article><nav class="theme-doc-breadcrumbs breadcrumbsContainer_TXlU" aria-label=Breadcrumbs><ul class=breadcrumbs><li class=breadcrumbs__item><a aria-label="Home page" class=breadcrumbs__link href=/><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class=breadcrumbHomeIcon_GokP><path d="M10 19v-5h4v5c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-7h1.7c.46 0 .68-.57.33-.87L12.67 3.6c-.38-.34-.96-.34-1.34 0l-8.36 7.53c-.34.3-.13.87.33.87H5v7c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1z" fill=currentColor /></svg></a><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class=breadcrumbs__link>Contributing</span><li class="breadcrumbs__item breadcrumbs__item--active"><span class=breadcrumbs__link>Contributing</span></ul></nav><div class="tocCollapsible_TlHs theme-doc-toc-mobile tocMobile_aaHP"><button type=button class="clean-btn tocCollapsibleButton_AEmy">On this page</button></div><div class="theme-doc-markdown markdown"><header><h1>Contributing</h1></header>
<p>We welcome contributions to OpenBao of any type, whether from users,
programmers, or even those curious about what OpenBao is! For more
general information, see our <a href=https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>CONTRIBUTING.md</code></a>
document in the root of <a href=https://github.com/openbao/openbao target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">our repository</a>.</p>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-warning admonition_wBnh alert alert--warning"><div class=admonitionHeading_kByF><span class=admonitionIcon_jbvL><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule=evenodd d="M8.893 1.5c-.183-.31-.52-.5-.887-.5s-.703.19-.886.5L.138 13.499a.98.98 0 0 0 0 1.001c.193.31.53.501.886.501h13.964c.367 0 .704-.19.877-.5a1.03 1.03 0 0 0 .01-1.002L8.893 1.5zm.133 11.497H6.987v-2.003h2.039v2.003zm0-3.004H6.987V5.987h2.039v4.006z"/></svg></span>warning</div><div class=admonitionContent_FvSw><p>Disable all generative AI agents while working on OpenBao!<p>(This includes GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Claude Code, and others.)<p>By using generative AI agents, you cannot guarantee that you have the full
legal rights required to submit the code generated by an AI. We require you
use the <a href=https://developercertificate.org/ target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">DCO ownership</a> sign-off, which
you cannot do with generative AI agents trained on third-party code.<p>Use of AI in other capacity (search, discussion, &c) remains fine.<p>Please do not submit such pull-requests to this project. Thanks!</div></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=community-roles>Community Roles<a href=#community-roles class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Community Roles" title="Direct link to Community Roles" translate=no>​</a></h2>
<p>For an overview of roles in our community and how to participate, see our
<a href=https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>MAINTAINERS.md</code></a>
file.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=chat-server>Chat server<a href=#chat-server class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Chat server" title="Direct link to Chat server" translate=no>​</a></h2>
<p>We use the Linux Foundation's Zulip server,
<a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/ target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/</code></a>,
and the following channels:</p>
<ul>
<li class=""><a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/529890-openssf-openbao-discussion target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>#openssf-openbao-discussion</code></a></li>
<li class=""><a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/530381-openssf-openbao-support target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>#openssf-openbao-support</code></a></li>
<li class=""><a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/530382-openssf-openbao-tsc target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>#openssf-openbao-tsc</code></a></li>
<li class="">Working Groups:<!-- -->
<ul>
<li class=""><a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/532995-openssf-openbao-wg-namespaces target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>#openssf-openbao-wg-namespaces</code></a></li>
<li class=""><a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/532994-openssf-openbao-wg-pkcs11 target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>#openssf-openbao-wg-pkcs11</code></a></li>
<li class=""><a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/532998-openssf-openbao-wg-scalability target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>#openssf-openbao-wg-scalability</code></a></li>
<li class=""><a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/532999-openssf-openbao-wg-supply target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>#openssf-openbao-wg-supply</code></a></li>
<li class=""><a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/532997-openssf-openbao-wg-ui target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>#openssf-openbao-wg-ui</code></a></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=community-calendar>Community calendar<a href=#community-calendar class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Community calendar" title="Direct link to Community calendar" translate=no>​</a></h2>
<p>The calendar for all OpenBao community meetings (TSC, community calls, and
working groups) is available as an <a href="https://calendar.proton.me/api/calendar/v1/url/TXBOnyq-2dy6n0mZhNS2omUAV9xMXEwSKtT6A0PESp-MmBra_wmKCcrphbYmtc19WUDxFyI91TyvVxpmHJa_Ew==/calendar.ics?CacheKey=iTNWshrTkVqEXZXKWfFhJg%3D%3D&PassphraseKey=OSkKSX6aCIZQuxsPfFIP6vMUKJ2Kpu6hRx7ObUSErPs%3D" target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">ICS from Proton</a>.</p>
<p>This links to Zoom meetings and meeting agendas.</p>
<p>For invites to particular calls through the LF's PCC, please let us know on
<a href=https://linuxfoundation.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/530382-openssf-openbao-tsc target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Zulip</a>.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=community-calls>Community calls<a href=#community-calls class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Community calls" title="Direct link to Community calls" translate=no>​</a></h2>
<p>The public EMEA/AMER community call is hosted every non-holiday Thursday, at
8AM Pacific, 11AM Eastern for 30 minutes on Zoom. The AMER/APAC community call
is held every other non-holiday Monday, at 2PM Pacific, 5PM Eastern for 30
minutes on Zoom.</p>
<p>Feel free to join and/or send agenda topics via email, GitHub discussion, or
on the Zulip server!</p>
<p>Meeting recordings are linked in the <a href=https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HZOjDpm0i2fD-W26FkmMQQStVYFgX3evP-nMpgiGmsA target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Community Call Agenda document</a>.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=tsc-calls>TSC calls<a href=#tsc-calls class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to TSC calls" title="Direct link to TSC calls" translate=no>​</a></h2>
<p>The public Technical Steering Committee (TSC) calls are hosted every second
Thursday of the month at 7AM Pacific, 10AM Eastern for 30 minutes on Zoom.
This bridge is stable from past meets and can be found from the recordings
below.</p>
<p>Feel free to join!</p>
<p>Meeting recordings are linked in the <a href=https://docs.google.com/document/d/1oNqm4GXCsIZbcNHsIqft4kgciRcuwS9rrIRGXlMz1yg target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">TSC Agenda document</a>.</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=tsc-charter>TSC charter<a href=#tsc-charter class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to TSC charter" title="Direct link to TSC charter" translate=no>​</a></h3>
<p>View our <a href=https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/CHARTER.md target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">charter</a>.</p>
<p>This charter was approved on <a href=https://lf-edge.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/OP/pages/15211981/2024-06-13+OpenBao+TSC+Meeting target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">2024-06-13</a> and revised 2025-06-05 to notate the move to the OpenSSF.</p>
